{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-11-1","title":"Psalms 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David encourages himself in God against his enemies. 4 The providence and justice of God.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2942. B.C. 1062. In the. 7:1; 9:10; 16:1; 25:2; 31:14; 56:11; 2Ch 14:11; 16:8; Isa 26:3,4 how. 1Sa 19:11; 20:38; 21:10-12; 22:3; 23:14; 27:1 Flee. 55:6,7; Pr 6:5; Lu 13:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-11-2","title":"Psalms 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>For, lo. 10:2; 37:14; 64:3,4; Jer 9:3 make. 21:12 that. 10:8,9; 64:5; 142:3; 1Sa 18:21; 23:9; Mt 26:4; Ac 23:12-15 privily. Heb. in darkness. the upright. 7:10; 32:11; 64:10; 94:15; 97:11; 125:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-11-3","title":"Psalms 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>If the. 75:3; 82:5; Isa 58:12; 2Ti 2:19 what. 2Ki 19:13-18; 22:12-14; 2Ch 32:13-15; Ne 6:10-12; Jer 26:11-15 Da 3:15-18; 6:10-28; Joh 11:8-10; Ac 4:5-12,24-33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-11-4","title":"Psalms 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>The Lord. 9:11; 18:6; Ex 40:34,35; 1Ch 17:5; Hab 2:20; Zec 2:13; 2Th 2:4 the Lord's. 2:4; 103:19; Isa 66:1; Mt 5:34; 23:21; Ac 7:49; Re 4:2 his eyes. 33:13; 44:21; 66:7; 2Ch 16:9; Pr 15:3; Jer 17:10; 23:24; Heb 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-11-5","title":"Psalms 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>trieth. 7:9; 17:3; 26:2; 139:1,23,24; Ge 22:1; Zec 13:9; Mal 3:3; Jas 1:12 1Pe 1:7; 4:12 wicked. 5:4,5; 10:3; 21:8; Pr 6:16-19; Jer 12:8; Zec 11:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-11-6","title":"Psalms 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Upon. 105:32; Ge 19:24; Ex 9:23,24; Job 18:15; 20:23; Isa 24:17,18 Eze 13:13; 38:22; Lu 17:29 snares. or, quick burning coals. an horrible, or, aburning. portion. 16:5; Ge 43:34; 1Sa 1:4; 9:23; Job 27:13-23 their. 75:8; Isa 51:17,22; Jer 25:15-17; Hab 2:16; Joh 18:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-11-7","title":"Psalms 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>For. 45:7; 99:4; 146:8; Isa 61:8 his. 5:12; 21:6; 33:18; 34:15; 42:5; Job 36:7; 1Pe 3:12</p>"}]}